From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bpereira <bpereira@cloudflare.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 09:25:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fast-path string-keyed Get/SetPropertyByValue and outline
 cold compile_expr arms

Add ordinary own-data string-key fast paths to GetPropertyByValue and SetPropertyByValue for non-digit-prefixed keys, and outline cold expression arms from ByteCompiler::compile_expr_impl so the hot dispatcher tiers up.
---
